      "description": "**The drop-off curve.** One observation per install: the highest campaign level it ever opened.\n\nThe cliff is the bar the population piles up against. A tall bar in the middle of the pack is a level people stop at rather than a level people finish — cross-check it against the clear-rate table below, because the two have different fixes: a level nobody clears is mis-rated, a level nobody *retries* is boring.\n\nCounts installs, not records, so a duplicated event cannot inflate a bar.",
      "fieldConfig": {
